The person who's been working
against us all this time

286
00:13:50,030 --> 00:13:52,160
is from the Southern Qin royal family.

287
00:14:05,040 --> 00:14:05,900
How is it going?

288
00:14:05,900 --> 00:14:06,780
Any progress?

289
00:14:08,130 --> 00:14:09,730
Do you want something to eat?

290
00:14:23,120 --> 00:14:24,200
This is...

291
00:14:26,030 --> 00:14:26,750
The scope is now

292
00:14:26,750 --> 00:14:28,440
narrowed down to
the Southern Qin royal family.

293
00:14:28,440 --> 00:14:29,600
But the Southern Qin royal family

294
00:14:29,600 --> 00:14:31,060
has thousands of members.

295
00:14:31,120 --> 00:14:33,070
So we have to check them one by one,

296
00:14:33,090 --> 00:14:34,170
look into their backgrounds,

297
00:14:34,170 --> 00:14:35,830
and rule them out one at a time.

298
00:14:46,850 --> 00:14:48,180
These jade pendants...

299
00:14:49,150 --> 00:14:50,750
Why do they look so familiar?

300
00:14:54,600 --> 00:14:56,080
I think I saw one on the person

301
00:14:56,080 --> 00:14:57,410
who killed me back then.

302
00:14:57,860 --> 00:14:59,860
But the pattern was a bit different.

303
00:15:02,390 --> 00:15:03,790
Draw it.

304
00:15:05,540 --> 00:15:06,030
Okay.

305
00:15:29,270 --> 00:15:30,400
It looked like this.

306
00:15:35,600 --> 00:15:36,910
A snake shape.

307
00:15:47,360 --> 00:15:49,080
I've seen this token before.

308
00:15:52,590 --> 00:15:53,710
The snake pattern

309
00:15:54,030 --> 00:15:55,630
is used by the Chief Eunuch.

310
00:15:56,670 --> 00:15:57,720
Could it be him?

311
00:15:59,480 --> 00:16:01,880
We've been looking in the wrong direction.

312
00:16:01,910 --> 00:16:02,870
In the palace,

313
00:16:03,240 --> 00:16:05,670
the people subject to the taboo weren't
just members of the imperial family,

314
00:16:05,670 --> 00:16:07,330
but also the palace servants.

315
00:16:07,480 --> 00:16:09,960
The one who could access
the core secret of immortality

316
00:16:09,960 --> 00:16:11,490
and become obsessed with it

317
00:16:12,080 --> 00:16:14,290
is the Emperor's chief eunuch,

318
00:16:15,150 --> 00:16:15,960
Liu Yi.

319
00:16:18,730 --> 00:16:21,330
He was the one
who caught Yu Tu to take his blood.

320
00:16:23,130 --> 00:16:25,060
He was also the one who injured you.

321
00:16:25,870 --> 00:16:27,200
Your Highness.

322
00:16:27,710 --> 00:16:31,160
You know what to do now, right?

323
00:16:32,190 --> 00:16:33,760
He was the one
who locked me in Duansi Palace,

324
00:16:33,760 --> 00:16:35,600
and forced me to marry.

325
00:16:36,710 --> 00:16:37,670
Impossible.

326
00:16:39,240 --> 00:16:41,100
He couldn't have lived until now.

327
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:43,240
Unless

328
00:16:44,570 --> 00:16:46,450
he used some dark magic.

329
00:16:49,480 --> 00:16:50,320
No wonder.

330
00:16:50,910 --> 00:16:52,270
He knows we can't die,

331
00:16:52,490 --> 00:16:54,310
and ordinary assassinations
are meaningless.

332
00:16:54,310 --> 00:16:56,370
So he presumptuously killed Lin Huai

333
00:16:56,570 --> 00:16:58,660
to find ways to torture you.

334
00:17:02,050 --> 00:17:03,440
I see.

335
00:17:04,440 --> 00:17:05,569
He is in the shadows,

336
00:17:06,200 --> 00:17:07,599
and we are out in the open.

337
00:17:11,440 --> 00:17:12,920
It's been 3,000 years.

338
00:17:17,440 --> 00:17:20,069
It's time to settle our grudge.

339
00:17:32,340 --> 00:17:33,980
[Survivor of General Yu's Rebellion,
Southern Qin]

340
00:17:36,830 --> 00:17:37,640
Here are all the men

341
00:17:37,640 --> 00:17:39,350
who've shown up around the areas
you and Ms. Song frequent

342
00:17:39,350 --> 00:17:40,270
over the past six months

343
00:17:40,270 --> 00:17:42,230
and look somewhat like

344
00:17:42,310 --> 00:17:43,970
the photo she reconstructed.

345
00:17:59,590 --> 00:18:00,650
Manager Qing Yuan.

346
00:18:02,790 --> 00:18:03,550
Mr. Ning,

347
00:18:04,110 --> 00:18:05,310
what brings you here?

348
00:18:05,540 --> 00:18:07,640
Why didn't you have your assistant
notify me in advance

349
00:18:07,640 --> 00:18:09,370
so I could greet you at the door?

350
00:18:10,160 --> 00:18:13,640
Are you looking for a new direction
for your collection today?

351
00:18:13,960 --> 00:18:15,350
Not exactly a direction.

352
00:18:15,350 --> 00:18:16,310
Your auction house

353
00:18:16,310 --> 00:18:17,750
handles a lot of items, right?

354
00:18:17,750 --> 00:18:19,020
I'd like you to help me check

355
00:18:19,020 --> 00:18:21,880
if you've ever seen
an identity token of this style.

356
00:18:26,590 --> 00:18:28,020
This identity token

357
00:18:28,390 --> 00:18:30,660
has strong Southern Qin characteristics.

358
00:18:30,660 --> 00:18:32,920
This is indeed an item from Southern Qin.

359
00:18:33,050 --> 00:18:34,850
The owner of this identity token

360
00:18:37,000 --> 00:18:37,930
is my old friend.

361
00:18:38,700 --> 00:18:39,500
Finding it

362
00:18:39,520 --> 00:18:41,090
might lead to news about him.

363
00:18:41,090 --> 00:18:42,720
So I hope you can keep an eye out.

364
00:18:42,720 --> 00:18:45,000
Whether on the market
or through private channels,

365
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:46,870
if you see anything
with a similar pattern,

366
00:18:46,870 --> 00:18:48,270
please notify me immediately.

367
00:18:48,270 --> 00:18:49,180
I have a friend

368
00:18:49,400 --> 00:18:52,310
who happens to be an expert
in Southern Qin artifacts.

369
00:18:52,310 --> 00:18:53,000
How about

370
00:18:53,270 --> 00:18:54,550
I contact them for you?

371
00:18:54,550 --> 00:18:55,350
That's great.

372
00:18:55,510 --> 00:18:56,550
Please contact them for me right away.

373
00:18:56,550 --> 00:18:57,510
I'll head over right now.

374
00:18:57,510 --> 00:18:58,160
Okay.

375
00:19:02,420 --> 00:19:04,350
I was recommended by Manager Qing Yuan.

376
00:19:04,350 --> 00:19:04,830
Okay.

377
00:19:18,240 --> 00:19:20,550
This is a unique writing style
of the Southern Qin royal family.

378
00:19:20,550 --> 00:19:22,680
that all royal children
and palace officials,

379
00:19:22,680 --> 00:19:24,160
when writing the character. "love",

380
00:19:24,160 --> 00:19:25,490
must add an extra stroke

381
00:19:25,830 --> 00:19:27,290
to emphasize its meaning.

382
00:19:29,300 --> 00:19:30,150
Qing Yuan.

383
00:19:32,790 --> 00:19:33,720
Where is Qing Yuan?

384
00:19:33,720 --> 00:19:34,520
She just left.

385
00:19:34,540 --> 00:19:36,190
Today is her last day at work.

386
00:19:37,550 --> 00:19:38,510
[Longevity and Love  Lidded Jar,
Southern Qin]

387
00:20:05,750 --> 00:20:07,160
Manager Qing Yuan.

388
00:20:07,830 --> 00:20:09,240
I brought you some fruit.

389
00:20:09,880 --> 00:20:10,810
Long time no see,

390
00:20:13,880 --> 00:20:14,950
Princess Ningjia.
